snxui (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * GTK4/Libadwaita interface.
  * Profile management and secure credential storage.
  * System tray via D-Bus StatusNotifierItem.
  * Polkit integration for privilege escalation.
  * Autostart support via XDG .desktop.

 -- SNX UI Contributors <snxui@example.com>  Sat, 28 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0300
